        "body": "<div>Booked by Manoj Kumar mk35@princeton.edu Please share anything that will help prepare for our meeting. Discuss eye tracking options while participants are performing a task. Also, would like to discuss:\n\n1. How to adjust font size for the questions, as some of the question fonts are tiny. I would also like to adjust the contrast of the font too. 2. Also waiting to hear back if my analysis file is processing the foreground time correctly. Faham had mentioned that he would speak to his data person and get us preprocessed data, that does something similar to my script.</div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<div> </div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: solid 1px #dadce0; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;\">\n<div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding:0;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:28px;\">\n<a href=\"https://meet.google.com/guc-ievk-gad?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/guc-ievk-gad?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\"></a><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #1a73e8; padding: 10px 25px; border: none; margin: 0;\">Join with Google Meet</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px;\"><tr><td><h2>Meeting link</h2></td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"color: #70757a;\"><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/guc-ievk-gad?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://mee